Standards-Version: 4.5.1

Package: convert-search-plugin
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, dde-grand-search
Description: DDE Grand Search 的单位/汇率/时间转换插件
 在 DDE 全局搜索栏中直接完成单位换算（长度/重量/温度/面积/体积/速度/数据）、
 汇率换算（联网获取+本地缓存+离线降级）与跨时区时间查询。结果以卡片展示，
 点击即复制到剪贴板。
 Convert units (length/weight/temperature/...), exchange rates (online with
 local cache and offline fallback), and cross-timezone time right from the
 DDE Grand Search bar. Results show as cards; click to copy to clipboard.
